<title>UK: Cypriot ro-ro, Dutch Antilles tanker collide.</title>
<headline>Cypriot ro-ro, Dutch Antilles tanker collide.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cypriot-flag ro-ro carrier Honshu I and Netherlands Antilles-registered tanker Mauro D'Alesio have collided off off Inchon, South Korea, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Mauro D'Alesio, 34,950 dwt, sustained damage to the starboard bow area and the Honshu I, 17,714 dwt, to the port bow area.</p>
</text>
